      "description": "A rendering, not a measurement. Eight-bit display codes under a fixed stretch, WEBP-compressed, with an alpha band marking absent data. R = COH12 VV over 0.10-0.80, G = COH12 VH over 0.10-0.60, B = VV/VH. The stretch is fixed rather than per-year so the year slider compares like with like. Its internal overviews average in display space, which is correct for a rendering and wrong for a measurement: read the float32 assets for anything but drawing.",
